WEBVTT

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:32.518
Allan, just say "stop" when I get to you
so that I know where you are,

00:10:32.542 --> 00:10:33.792
where to face.

00:10:35.417 --> 00:10:36.667
Allan: Stop.

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:39.958
DB: You a Capricorn?
Allan: Yes.

00:10:41.458 --> 00:10:44.625
DB: So Allan has something in his head.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.476
Now, did you hear it,
hear the reserve in his voice?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.476
It's going to be something really tricky.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.809
I think with you ...
Just say "yes" again for me?

00:10:52.833 --> 00:10:54.083
Allan: Yes.

00:10:56.042 --> 00:10:57.476
DB: It's going to be either --

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.768
no it's not.

00:10:58.792 --> 00:11:03.268
It's access, it's a password
or access to something.